UID:10060323-1787281200-1787367599@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Leftover Salmon Brew Ridge Jam w/sg  Empire Strikes Brass & Coyote Rodeo plus Jon Stickley + Jonathan Scales
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, August 21  •  4 PM – 11 PM | Event Details and Tickets \nAsheville ‘Brew Ridge Jam’ just popped!!!  Welcome to the party Jon Stickley + Jonathan Scales \nOur annual Brew Ridge Jam returns to Asheville\, NC on August 21st at French Broad River Brewery with special guests Empire Strikes Brass & Coyote Rodeo. Don’t miss out on the free beer tasting and indoor taproom music featuring JR and ScareKrow from 4-6PM. \nLeftover Salmon is an American jam band from Boulder\, Colorado\, formed in 1989. The band’s music is a blend of bluegrass\, rock\, country\, and Cajun/Zydeco. In their fourth decade as a band\, Leftover Salmon’s current lineup has been together longer than any other and is one of their strongest ever. Built around founding members Drew Emmitt and Vince Herman\, the band is now powered by banjo wizard Andy Thorn\, the steady rhythm section of bassist Greg Garrison and drummer Alwyn Robinson\, along with dobro and keyboard player Jay Starling. This lineup continues Salmon’s storied history\, which began with their roots in progressive bluegrass and evolved as they became one of the original jam bands and the architects of what is now known as jamgrass. \n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/leftover-salmon-brew-ridge-jam-w-sg-empire-strikes-brass-coyote-rodeo/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/769309624_1080671247716223_2940148959228774668_n-e1786375783315.jpg
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=French Broad River Brewery 101 Fairview Rd Asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=101 Fairview Rd:geo:-82.5374054,35.5662722
END:VEVENT
