UID:10053881-1787342400-1787353200@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Quinn Sternberg's Mind Beach & Special Guest Chris Bullock
DESCRIPTION:Led by Asheville bassist and composer Quinn Sternberg\, Mind Beach is known throughout the Carolinas for its adventurous improvisation and thoughtful songwriting. Drawing from Sternberg’s five studio albums alongside an ever-evolving repertoire\, the band creates a fluid\, genre-blurring sound that DownBeat Magazine praised as “complex yet digestible.” The quartet brings an energetic\, deeply connected approach to every performance. \nFeaturing: \nQuinn Sternberg – Bass \nJacob Rodriguez – Saxophone \nTim Fischer – Guitar \nJoe Enright – Drums \n& Special Guest: Chris Bullock \nChris Bullock is a multi-instrumentalist\, composer\, and producer known for his work on saxophones\, flutes\, clarinets\, and keyboards. Over the years\, he has expanded his artistic voice through composition and music production\, crafting a distinctive and continually evolving sound. \nSince 2005\, Chris has been a member and composer of the acclaimed genre-defying ensemble Snarky Puppy. With the band\, he has earned five Grammy Awards and performs regularly at leading concert halls and major music festivals around the world. \n$15 at the door (all ticket proceeds are 100% passed to the band\, backed by a living wage guarantee from Hotel Eve) \n*Reserve a table in advance\, or join us impromptu the night of the show. Reservations/advance tickets are recommended for preferred seating\, but not required. Tickets are available at the door on a first-come\, first-served basis.  Event Details and Tickets \nHotel Eve is your locally rooted\, speakeasy jazz club & cocktail bar\, hidden in the heart of Downtown Asheville. Mysteriously not a hotel…check in for spirits\, souls and jazz! We’re tucked away\, on purpose. You’ll find us behind the gate nestled between Virtue Boutique and Dane Wells Gallery at 56 N Lexington Avenue in downtown Asheville. Step through\, take a left into the courtyard\, check in for Spirits\, Souls & Jazz. We’ll be waiting on the other side. hotelevejazz.com \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/quinn-sternbergs-mind-beach-3/
LOCATION:Hotel Eve Jazz\, 56 N Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/unnamed-5-e1786899712810.png
GEO:35.5967716;-82.5530826
