SUMMARY:Adam Knight's Buried Alive - The Phinest Phish Tribute\,
DESCRIPTION:Adam Knight’s Buried Alive – The Phinest Phish Tribute\, is back at Pisgah Brewing on Friday\, August 21st! Always an amazing show! Grab your tickets soon! TWO SETS of PHISH!Pisgah Brewing Company2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC 28711Show: 8:30pm TWO SETS of PHISH!!ADV: $12 DOS: $15 click here!Multi-genre guitarist and Phish devotee\, Adam Knight\, has brought together an exceptional group of musicians to celebrate the music of Phish. Adam Knight’s Buried Alive is known for precisely executing the most complex Phish compositions. The band uses their favorite Phish tunes as a launching pad for their own high-energy\, intense jams. This cathartic celebration is what phans live for. Adam Knight’s Buried Alive is currently booking regional shows and always building their repertoire. \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom with live music several days a week\, plus our outdoor music venue in the summer and fall months with live music frequently on WNC’s premier outdoor music venue\, the Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage. Bric’s Dip & Roll will be open Wednesday-Sunday from 4-10pm at the taproom! Be sure to come hungry\, thirsty and ready rock! Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/adam-knights-buried-alive-the-phinest-phish-tribute/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-15-175030-e1786830707685.png
