SUMMARY:Andrew Thelston and Izzi Hughes
DESCRIPTION:Join us this Friday night from 8:30PM-11:30PM for live music by Andrew Thelston and Izzi Hughes. \nIzzi Hughes and Andrew Thelston\, two powerhouse local musicians\, deliver an unforgettable show packed with soaring vocals\, masterful guitar work\, and rich harmonies. Thelston—frontman of the award-winning Andrew Thelston Band—brings high-energy\, funk-infused rock ’n’ roll\, while Hughes\, an acclaimed vocalist and local favorite\, delivers a soulful voice and magnetic stage presence. Together\, they span decades of music—from Fleetwood Mac to Lady Gaga—sprinkled with originals that are sure to become new favorites \n  \nBarley’s – Asheville’s Original Downtown Gathering Place Since 1994\, serving amazing pizza\, wings\, salads & more with two full bars\, pool tables\, darts\, shuffleboard\, and an experienced & friendly staff. \nLive Music. DJs. Craft Beer. Cocktails. Pizza. Late Nights. Open Thursday-Monday with late night food. barleystaproom.com \n*21+ only; valid ID required
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/andrew-thelston-carrie-morrison-2/
LOCATION:Barley’s Downtown\, 42 Biltmore Ave\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
