SUMMARY:JLloyd Presents: Queens of Soul ft. Reggie Headen & Leeda Lyric Jones
DESCRIPTION:JLloyd Presents Queens of Soul featuring Reggie Headen & Leeda Lyric Jones!\nBand:•Jonathan Lloyd – Trombone/Vocals•Brandon Phelps – Drums•Rob Geisler- Bass•Duane Simpson – Guitar•Taylor Pierson – Keys•Ben Colvin – Sax\nShow will be going late and is a great choice for an after show following Downtown After 5 or other earlier events in town.\n$10 Cover\n\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jlloyd-presents-queens-of-soul-ft-reggie-headen-leeda-lyric-jones/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
